        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "World of Tanks Blitz is truly World of Tanks on-the-go. It has the great visuals and satisfying controls, both built from the ground up to feel natural on the platform. And it has the same great tank-battle gameplay that World of Tanks has been known for. Furthermore, we intend to keep Blitz updated regularly with free content updates that give everyone access to new vehicles, maps, and game modes.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "World of Tanks Blitz es World of Tanks para llevar contigo. Tiene gráficos y controles de gran calidad, ambos creados desde cero para que resulten naturales en la plataforma. Y ofrece la misma gran jugabilidad de batallas de tanques por la que es conocido World of Tanks. Además, tenemos la intención de mantener Blitz actualizado con regularidad mediante contenido gratuito con nuevos vehículos, mapas y modos de juego para todos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2014",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
